<title>USA: WSFS sets 10 pct stock buyback.</title>
<headline>WSFS sets 10 pct stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>WSFS Financial Corp said Friday its board had approved the buyback of up to 10 percent of the company's outstanding common stock, or 1.25 million shares.</p>
</text>
